    <string name="rationale_health_connect_title">Connect Health Connect?</string>
    <string name="rationale_health_connect_message">VitQuest will only read your daily step count from Health Connect to show your progress. It does not write anything and the data stays on this device. You can remove access at any time in Health Connect.</string>
    <string name="rationale_sensor_title">Use the phone step sensor?</string>
    <string name="rationale_sensor_message">Android will ask for the Physical activity permission so VitQuest can read your phone\'s step counter. Steps are stored only on this device. You can turn this off at any time in system settings.</string>
    <string name="hc_privacy_title">How VitQuest uses health data</string>
    <string name="hc_privacy_body">VitQuest reads only your daily step totals from Health Connect. They are used to show today\'s steps, your weekly progress and your step history. VitQuest does not write to Health Connect, does not read any other health data, and does not send health data to any server or third party. Data stays on this device and is deleted when you use Delete all data in Settings or uninstall the app. You can withdraw access at any time in Health Connect.</string>
